  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-wangdao-source:zhongxing" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-wangdao-source:zhongxing:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAA">王洽</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-wangdao-source:zhongxing:m0003" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAA">敬和</persName>，丞相<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-wangdao-source:zhongxing:m0008" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAA">導</persName>第三子，累遷吳郡內史，為士民所懷。徵拜中領軍，尋加中書令，不拜。年二十六而卒。</p>
